  <x:String x:Key="Text.Stash.After.KeepIndex.Description" xml:space="preserve">儲存到貯藏後，本地保留已暫存的修改。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Stash.After.KeepAll" xml:space="preserve">保留全部本機修改</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Stash.After.KeepAll.Description" xml:space="preserve">建立貯藏副本，本地仍保留相同的暫存和未暫存修改。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.UI.AdvancedOptions" xml:space="preserve">進階選項</x:String>
