  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.OptionalPassword" xml:space="preserve">密碼（可留空）</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.GitHubTokenLabel">個人存取權杖：</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.GitHubTokenPlaceholder">GitHub 個人存取權杖（PAT）</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.GitHubTokenRequired">請輸入 GitHub 個人存取權杖（PAT）。GitHub 的 HTTPS Git 驗證不接受帳號密碼。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.GitHubTokenHelp">為此儲存庫建立權杖。拉取時授予 Contents 讀取權限，推送時授予讀寫權限。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.PasswordHint" xml:space="preserve">密碼</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.TogglePassword" xml:space="preserve">顯示／隱藏密碼</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.Authentication" xml:space="preserve">儲存庫帳號與密碼</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.RepositoryCaption" xml:space="preserve">儲存庫：</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.ServerCaption" xml:space="preserve">伺服器：</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.Retry" xml:space="preserve">驗證失敗，請檢查帳號、密碼或權杖並重新輸入。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.PermissionDenied">遠端拒絕存取。請檢查目前帳號的儲存庫存取權限，以及權杖是否已獲得所需權限。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.RepositoryUnavailable">遠端儲存庫不存在或對目前帳號不可見。請核對遠端位址與儲存庫存取權限。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.ServerError">遠端伺服器傳回錯誤。請在服務恢復後重試。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.Verifying">正在驗證…</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.PushUnavailable">暫時無法驗證推送權限，已保留你的修改和提交說明。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.Success">驗證成功</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.Timeout">驗證逾時，請檢查網路連線後重試。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Credentials.ConnectionFailed">暫時無法驗證，請檢查網路連線後重試。</x:String>
