  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Remote.SelectKey" xml:space="preserve">選擇 SSH 私密金鑰</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Remote.OptionalKey" xml:space="preserve">SSH 私密金鑰：</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Ok" xml:space="preserve">確定</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Remote.InvalidName" xml:space="preserve">請輸入有效的遠端名稱（字母、數字、底線、點或連字號）。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Remote.NameExists" xml:space="preserve">同名遠端儲存庫已存在。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Remote.InvalidUrl" xml:space="preserve">請輸入有效的遠端位址或本機儲存庫路徑。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Remote.KeyMissing" xml:space="preserve">找不到指定的 SSH 私密金鑰檔案。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.TreeGit.Remote.SaveFailed" xml:space="preserve">儲存失敗，請查看儲存庫命令記錄。</x:String>
